<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n1095" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀγων-ία</span></b> , ἡ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>contest, struggle for victory</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀγὼν διὰ πάσης ἀγωνίης ἔχων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hdt.
					2.91
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πολεμίων ἀ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					E.
					<u>Hec.</u>
					314
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				<u>Tr.</u>
				1003
			</span></i>; esp. in games, <i><span class="en">
				Pi.
				<u>O.</u>
				2.52
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>P.</u>
				5.113
			</span></i>:—also in Prose, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐν δημοτικῇ ἀ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					X.
					<u>Cyr.</u>
					2.3.15
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἅπασαν ἀ. ἐκτεἶναι</span> [<i><span class="en">
				D.
			</span></i>]<i><span class="en">
				60.30
			</span></i>, etc. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>gymnastic exercise</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hp.
				<u>Art.</u>
				11
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Men.</u>
				94b
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Lg.</u>
				765c
			</span></i>, etc.: generally, <i>exercise</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				<u>Grg.</u>
				456d
			</span></i> sq., <i><span class="en">
				<u>R.</u>
				618b
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b> of the mind,
				<i>agony, anguish</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐν φόβῳ καὶ πολλῇ ἀ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					D.
					18.33
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Men.
				534.12
			</span></i> (pl.), <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>Pr.</u>
				869b6
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐν τοῖς τῆς ψυχῆς φόβοις, ἐλπίσιν,
					ἀγωνίαις</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>Spir.</u>
					483a5
				</span></i>
			; cf. <i><span class="en">
				Chrysipp.Stoic.
				2.248
			</span></i>, al., <i><span class="en">
				Phld.
				<u>Ir.</u>
			</span></i>p <i><span class="en">
				56
			</span></i> W. (pl.), <i><span class="en">
				Nic.Dam.
				<u>Vit. Caes.</u>
				9
			</span></i>.</div>
